Date: Thu, 7 Nov 2024 15:06:57 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: SAUCE: vfio/nvgrace-egm: Free region memory during
 unregistration

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2119656

Free the kmalloc'd region when the EGM is unregistered.

